# Local secrets for `npx wrangler dev` (never commit the real .dev.vars).
# SERVER-side values — these run in the Cloudflare function runtime and never
# reach the browser bundle. (The client-side site needs no env file at all:
# all client config has safe defaults baked into src/data/site.js.)
#
# Telegram is the ONLY delivery path for contact-form inquiries:
# every submission arrives on your phone as a Telegram message.
#
# Setup (free, 2 minutes):
#   1. Message @BotFather (https://t.me/BotFather) → /newbot → copy the bot token
#   2. Send your new bot any message (e.g. "hi")
#   3. Open https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates → copy chat.id
#
# Then: cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars   ← put the REAL values in .dev.vars
# (.dev.vars is gitignored; this template stays committed with empty values)
NOTIFY_TELEGRAM_TOKEN=""
NOTIFY_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=""
